          "@value": "Nurse"
        }
      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        "Nursing professional",
        "ISCO-08 2221"
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "A nursing professional (ISCO-08 code 2221) who prepares and administers medications at the point of care, monitors patient responses, and detects and reports suspected SF medical products when observing packaging anomalies, particulate contamination, or unexpected clinical responses."
        }
      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "Cluster C persona specialization from §4.1 (p. 25), Table 7 (p. 25), and Table 9 scenario 2 (p. 27). Bound to DAK persona `SFP-R-02`.",
